      "content": "wait vinegar?? i thought that would make it burn more lol. and i dont really have a way to do that for 15 mins straight right now. can i just use those homeopathic chamomile drops i have? i feel like they'll soothe the irritation faster than just plain water and i really dont want to go to the ER if i can help it.",
