      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it's not like a lot got in, just a tiny splash. i'm mostly worried about the stinging. if i use the chamomile drops, wouldn't that basically just neutralize the feeling? i really dont want to spend hours in the waiting room for a tiny splash of cleaner. is there any other way to just patch this up at home so i can sleep it off?",
